        "incapacitation",
        "mental",
        "occult"
      ],
      "text": "Trigger The dragon rolls initiative\n\n---\nEffect The dragon targets all enemies it can see within 60 feet with Calm heightened to a rank equal to half the dragon's level rounded up (DC 35 Will save save). The dragon doesn't need to Sustain this effect, but if the dragon takes any hostile action against those affected, it breaks the effect for all creatures.",
